</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhere <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>Finally then, we can work out the definite integral:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabind